  {
   "id": "b07-text-9",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 765,
   "height": 175,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 71271,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 942561,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Step  Example     PLR → D (primary)  Candidates  (NP = node-prot., DS = downstream)   Best\n----  ----------  -----------------  ------------------------------------------------  ----\n1     §15 policy  S → D   (via E)    A: DS, cost 12      B: NP, cost 13                B\n1     6           N → D   (via E)    S: –, cost 3        M: NP, cost 20                M\n2     4 ISP core  P4 → PE1 (via P2)  P1: NP DS, cost 50  P3: NP, cost 50               P1\n3     §15, both   S → D   (via E)    A: cost 12          B: cost 13                    A\n      ignore\n3     11          D → S   (via E)    A: NP DS, cost 40   B: NP DS, cost 30             B\n4     5 leaf-     SP1 → SP2          L2, L3, L4: NP DS, cost 20 each                   L2\n      spine       (fail L1–SP1)",
   "originalText": "Step  Example     PLR → D (primary)  Candidates  (NP = node-prot., DS = downstream)   Best\n----  ----------  -----------------  ------------------------------------------------  ----\n1     §15 policy  S → D   (via E)    A: DS, cost 12      B: NP, cost 13                B\n1     6           N → D   (via E)    S: –, cost 3        M: NP, cost 20                M\n2     4 ISP core  P4 → PE1 (via P2)  P1: NP DS, cost 50  P3: NP, cost 50               P1\n3     §15, both   S → D   (via E)    A: cost 12          B: cost 13                    A\n      ignore\n3     11          D → S   (via E)    A: NP DS, cost 40   B: NP DS, cost 30             B\n4     5 leaf-     SP1 → SP2          L2, L3, L4: NP DS, cost 20 each                   L2\n      spine       (fail L1–SP1)",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b07-text-10",
   "type": "text",
