  {
   "id": "b07-text-11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 385,
   "width": 840,
   "height": 88,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1152019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "§15   A: 10 + dist(A,D) 2 = 12, but A → E → D: 2 < 1 + 1 ✗ not NP.  B: 2 + 11 = 13, 11 < 12 + 1 ✓ NP\n6     S: 1 + 2 = 3, S → E → D: 2 < 1 + 1 ✗.  M: 10 + 10 = 20, 10 < 11 + 1 ✓\n4     P1: c(P4,P1) 40 + 10 = 50, 10 < 20 ✓ DS.  P3: 30 + 20 = 50, 20 < 20 ✗\n11    A: 30 + 10 = 40.  B: 15 + 15 = 30   (IGP metric, not the Flex-Algo delay)\n5     each: 10 + 10 = 20, all NP and DS: the lowest id L2 wins",
   "originalText": "§15   A: 10 + dist(A,D) 2 = 12, but A → E → D: 2 < 1 + 1 ✗ not NP.  B: 2 + 11 = 13, 11 < 12 + 1 ✓ NP\n6     S: 1 + 2 = 3, S → E → D: 2 < 1 + 1 ✗.  M: 10 + 10 = 20, 10 < 11 + 1 ✓\n4     P1: c(P4,P1) 40 + 10 = 50, 10 < 20 ✓ DS.  P3: 30 + 20 = 50, 20 < 20 ✗\n11    A: 30 + 10 = 40.  B: 15 + 15 = 30   (IGP metric, not the Flex-Algo delay)\n5     each: 10 + 10 = 20, all NP and DS: the lowest id L2 wins",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b07-text-12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 483,
   "width": 950,
   "height": 40,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 95028,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1256748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Step 5 needs two equal links to the same neighbor, equal on every other step. None of the examples reaches\nit; Example 7’s bundle S–E has metrics 10 and 20, so step 3 decides there.",
   "originalText": "Step 5 needs two equal links to the same neighbor, equal on every other step. None of the examples reaches\nit; Example 7’s bundle S–E has metrics 10 and 20, so step 3 decides there.",
